{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 192, "line_no": 21, "text": "的美称。", "bbox_px": {"x": 88, "y": 1368, "w": 149, "h": 56}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "的美称。", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 88, "y": 1368, "w": 149, "h": 56}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 192, "line_no": 22, "text": "布依族地区的农村手工业生产，大都未脱离农业而独立存在，大部分属于自给自足", "bbox_px": {"x": 169, "y": 1432, "w": 1463, "h": 57}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "布依族地区的农村手工业生产，大都未脱离农业而独立存在，大部分属于自给自足", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 169, "y": 1432, "w": 1463, "h": 57}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 192, "line_no": 23, "text": "的家庭手工业。主要有手工纺织、制糖、酿米酒、烧石灰、造纸等。", "bbox_px": {"x": 88, "y": 1505, "w": 1126, "h": 48}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "的家庭手工业。主要有手工纺织、制糖、酿米酒、烧石灰、造纸等。", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 88, "y": 1505, "w": 1126, "h": 48}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 192, "line_no": 24, "text": "手工纺织习俗。家庭土布纺织是布依族的传统手工业，在农村多属于个体生产，每", "bbox_px": {"x": 169, "y": 1569, "w": 1463, "h": 48}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "手工纺织习俗。家庭土布纺织是布依族的传统手工业，在农村多属于个体生产，每", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 169, "y": 1569, "w": 1463, "h": 48}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 192, "line_no": 25, "text": "户人家均有自制的轧花机、纺纱机和织布机，在过去生产的土布主要可以概括为“五自”，", "bbox_px": {"x": 88, "y": 1629, "w": 1548, "h": 53}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "户人家均有自制的轧花机、纺纱机和织布机，在过去生产的土布主要可以概括为“五自”，", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 88, "y": 1629, "w": 1548, "h": 53}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 192, "line_no": 26, "text": "即自种（棉花）、自纺（纱）、自织（布）、自染（布）、自用；自鸦片战争后，由于棉花和洋纱的", "bbox_px": {"x": 92, "y": 1698, "w": 1540, "h": 48}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "即自种（棉花）、自纺（纱）、自织（布）、自染（布）、自用；自鸦片战争后，由于棉花和洋纱的", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 92, "y": 1698, "w": 1540, "h": 48}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 192, "line_no": 27, "text": "大量输人，消解了自种和自纺", "bbox_px": {"x": 1122, "y": 1762, "w": 511, "h": 48}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "大量输人，消解了自种和自纺", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 1122, "y": 1762, "w": 511, "h": 48}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
